                "reasoning": "The coach is required to reposition to one of three strategic locations. The first option is to maneuver around the opponent, which can be interpreted as moving either to the left (constraint A) or to the right (constraint B) of the opponent. The second option is to position directly in front of the goal; we model this by requiring the coach to be 'close to' the goal (constraint C) within a threshold distance (here set arbitrarily to 5.0 units). Finally, the coach may move to a specified position that is defined by a field zone \u2013 this is captured using the in_zone API (constraint D). The overall logical composition is an OR among all these alternatives, meaning that if any one of these conditions is satisfied, the constraint on the destination position is met."
