                "reasoning": "To determine that the Coach is in position to receive the ball back, we want to verify that there exists a clear and valid passing angle from the teammate (who received the ball after the initial pass) to the Coach. The has_angle_of_pass API directly tests if the passing lane between these two players is unobstructed (i.e. not crossing any circle of a given radius around an opponent). Using this API captures the strategic positioning of the Coach for the give-and-go play. Thus, we compose the condition using only this API."
